<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 2. </span>Overview of dataset characteristics for the full-document version of CRUMB. <math id="S1.T2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{Q}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{Q}</annotation></semantics></math> is the number of evaluation queries, <math id="S1.T2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math> is the number of documents in the corpus. Avg <math id="S1.T2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}^{+}_{NB}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}^{+}_{NB}</annotation></semantics></math> and Avg <math id="S1.T2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}^{+}_{B}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}^{+}_{B}</annotation></semantics></math> are the average number of relevant documents per query for non-binary and binary relevance judgments, respectively. Avg <math id="S1.T2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\mathcal{Q}|_{char}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒬</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\mathcal{Q}|_{char}</annotation></semantics></math> and Avg <math id="S1.T2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\mathcal{D}|_{char}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>h</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\mathcal{D}|_{char}</annotation></semantics></math> are the average character lengths of queries and documents.</figcaption>
