<tr id="S3.T3.2.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T3.2.1.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r">StackExchange</td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Given a question, find relevant documents that can help answer it</td></tr>
