<td id="S3.T3.2.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Given a patient’s medical history, find clinical trials that are relevant to them</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T3.2.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T3.2.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_r">Legal QA</td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.1.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Given a query, find relevant legal documents which satisfy the requirements</td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T3.2.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
