<tr id="S3.T3.2.1.9" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T3.2.1.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb ltx_border_r">Code Retrieval</td>
<td id="S3.T3.2.1.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb">Given a code question, find code snippets that would answer it</td></tr>
